# Raw run output. AGENTS.md keeps generated raw runs out of the repository and
# curated, README-worthy artifacts in results/.
outdir/
logs/
results/*.jsonl

# results/summary.json and results/README.md ARE committed: 16 KB of curated
# aggregates and paired statistics standing in for 3.7 MB of raw rows, and the
# evidence behind every number in README.md. Regenerate with utils/summarise.py.

# Working documents for this reproduction effort, not part of the deliverable.
# LOG.md is the running decision log, VISITED_URLS.md the resource trail,
# FEEDBACK.md is feedback on the reproduction workflow itself, and CONFLUENCE.md
# a summary staged for publication elsewhere. README.md is the committed record.
LOG.md
VISITED_URLS.md
FEEDBACK.md
CONFLUENCE.md

# Environment
.venv/
requirements_frozen.txt

